The specification document formalizes the functional and non-functional requirements of the interconnected platform :

1. Functional Requirements - Client Side (Web & Mobile) :
  • Detailed browsing of the vehicle fleet and catalog items categorized by sector;
  • Multi-criteria vehicle filtering (make, category, transmission, air conditioning);
  • Date selection with dynamic pricing based on geographical destination (Abidjan / Regional zones) and driver option;
  • Multi-item cart management with instant one-click booking validation;
  • Instant download of official pro-forma PDF quotes complying with company legal guidelines;
  • Personal customer dashboard to view order history and reservation statuses.

2. Functional Requirements - Administrator Side :
  • Global supervision of key business indicators (estimated revenue, active reservations);
  • Complete fleet management (vehicle creation, specifications update, maintenance status);

